      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOPE'S JACKY (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (25.48) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 457m. Winning claims. BLUE LAKODA (4) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 19.68 beating Tuckeroo Road. The form out of her last race has been franked. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. DONNIE THORNBURY (5) has not raced since scoring (31.24) over 520m at Wanganui three months ago. Record off this box is sound. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. AUSSIE ZIP (1) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can make amends.",
